# Funtroo — Cursor Rules
# This file configures AI behavior in Cursor IDE for this project.

## Project
Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + MongoDB adult wellness e-commerce.
Site: funtroo.in | 18+ only | India market

## Color System — ALWAYS use these Tailwind tokens, NEVER hardcode hex
- bg-f-dark (#1E1B4B) — nav, hero backgrounds
- bg-f-purple (#6B21A8) — primary buttons, CTAs
- bg-f-mid (#7C3AED) — button hover
- bg-f-accent (#A855F7) — icons, highlights
- bg-f-light (#EDE9FE) — section backgrounds
- bg-f-soft (#F5F3FF) — page background
- border-f-border (#DDD6FE) — all borders
- text-f-muted (#A78BFA) — secondary text
- text-f-gray (#6B7280) — body text
- text-f-pink (#BE185D) — discount badges
- text-f-green (#065F46) — success
- text-f-dark (#1E1B4B) — headings on light bg

## Typography
- font-display = "Cormorant Garamond" serif — headings
- font-sans = "DM Sans" — body
- DO NOT import fonts in components — already loaded in globals.css

## Always
- Call `await connectDB()` before any DB operation in API routes
- Use `mongoose.models.X || mongoose.model('X', Schema)` pattern
- Use `useCart()` from lib/store.ts — never create local cart state
- Wrap API routes in try/catch, return `NextResponse.json({ error: e.message }, { status: 500 })`
- Add `'use client'` to any component with hooks or event handlers
- Use lucide-react for all icons
- Use toast from react-hot-toast for notifications
- Blog HTML content: render with `dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: blog.content }}`
- Import loyalty logic from lib/loyalty.ts: getTier, calcCardDiscount, TIERS

## Loyalty Card Tiers
- Silver: 5% off — ₹0+ lifetime spend — auto on signup
- Gold: 10% off — ₹10,000+ lifetime spend — auto after order
- Platinum: 15% off — ₹50,000+ lifetime spend — auto after order

## Never
- Never hardcode hex colors — use f-* Tailwind tokens
- Never use <form action=""> — always use onSubmit + preventDefault
- Never import Google Fonts in component files
- Never expose passwords — always select('-password') on customer queries
- Never skip connectDB() in API routes
- Never create local cart state — always use useCart() Zustand hook
- Never write raw Mongoose queries in page components — use models
- Never put admin logic in non-admin routes without role check

## File Locations
- Pages: app/***/page.tsx
- API: app/api/***/route.ts
- Components: components/ComponentName.tsx (PascalCase)
- Models: models/ModelName.ts (PascalCase)
- Business logic: lib/*.ts (camelCase)
- Admin pages: app/admin/***/page.tsx (all 'use client')

## Component Patterns
- Cards: bg-white border border-f-border rounded-2xl
- Buttons primary: bg-f-purple text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-f-mid transition
- Buttons ghost: border border-f-border text-f-gray rounded-xl hover:bg-f-soft
- Input: border border-f-border rounded-xl px-3 py-2 outline-none focus:border-f-purple
- Loading: animate-pulse bg-f-border/30 rounded-2xl
- Section heading: font-display text-3xl text-f-dark

## Env Variables Needed
MONGODB_URI, NEXTAUTH_SECRET, NEXTAUTH_URL,
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID, RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET, NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID,
ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD
